WEBVTT

00:02:27.318 --> 00:02:30.767
and you print your own personal medicine.

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:33.019
And if that doesn't seem fanciful enough,

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.067
where do you think we're going to go?

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:39.651
Well, you're going to have your own personal matter fabricator.

00:02:39.651 --> 00:02:41.551
Beam me up, Scotty.

00:02:41.551 --> 00:02:44.900
(Applause)